---
fmContentType: glossaryEntry
term: "Full-spectrum"
letter: "F"
anchor: "full-spectrum"
category: "cannabinoids"
---

A cannabis or hemp extract that retains all the naturally occurring cannabinoids, terpenes, and other plant compounds — including trace amounts of THC (up to 0.3% in hemp-derived products). Full-spectrum products are favored by proponents of the entourage effect for their potentially more complex, nuanced effect profile. Contrast with broad-spectrum (THC removed) and isolate (single cannabinoid only).
